            "for_sale_from_another_site": "http://netformers.dozuki.com/Item/Gabelschlüsselset"
        }
    ],
    "steps": [
        {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "Various types available",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/wREUhHmuLCKT2mWn.medium",
            "image_alt": "Felco Gartenschere - Pruners Disassembly, Various types available: step 1, image 1 of 1",
            "instructions": [
                "There are several types - e.g. also for left-handers, here a Felco Nr 4 is shown."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/77310/154105",
            "translate_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/translate/77310/154105/en",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Felco+Gartenschere+-+Pruners+Disassembly/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "Release mother",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/TOcHWIxdGl2MSF4A.medium",
            "image_alt": "Felco Gartenschere - Pruners Disassembly, Release mother: step 2, image 1 of 1",
            "instructions": [
                "First, the upper nut SW 13 is released, then the scissors is turned over.",
                "The spring can be easily removed."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/77310/154106",
            "translate_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/translate/77310/154106/en",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Felco+Gartenschere+-+Pruners+Disassembly/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "Release screw from below",
            "instructions": [
                "Now the hinge screw can be unscrewed. Here SW 14 is used Next to it lies the spring and the lock nut.",
                "Now the scissors can be completely disassembled.",
                "The blade is pinned with three bolts in the handle half and usually dissolves easily."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/77310/154107",
            "translate_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/translate/77310/154107/en",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Felco+Gartenschere+-+Pruners+Disassembly/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 4,
            "title": "The items",
            "instructions": [
                "The scissors are disassembled. We see the pivot nut, the hinge screw, the spring, the two handles and the blade."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/77310/154108",
            "translate_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/translate/77310/154108/en",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Felco+Gartenschere+-+Pruners+Disassembly/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        },
        {
            "step_number": 5,
            "title": "maintenance",
            "instructions": [
                "The blade is ground on one side. Sharpen the beveled edge with about 15 degrees, only deburr the straight edge with a maximum of 5 degrees.",
                "The parts should be free from rust and freshly oiled or greased."
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/77310/154109",
            "translate_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/translate/77310/154109/en",
            "comments": {
                "add_comment_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Felco+Gartenschere+-+Pruners+Disassembly/",
                "add_comment_text": "Add a comment"
            }
        }
    ],
    "conclusion": "Repeat the steps in order to reassemble your device.",
